<title>UK: IFC sets 27.5 billion Greek drachma five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>IFC sets 27.5 billion Greek drachma five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Barclays Athens and Alpha Credit Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   INTERNATIONAL FINANCE CORP</p>
<p> AMT    27.5 BLN GDR  BASE	3M-ATHIBOR MATURITY    27.AUG.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN    -75 BP     PAY DATE    27.AUG.97</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   20 BP</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 REOFFER    PAR</p>
<p> LISTING    ATHENS    DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   STD IFC</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GREEK     HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   NON STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    15 BP     SELL CONC  5 BP	PRAECIPUUM  10 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	SENIOR, UNSECURED AND UNSUBORDINATED</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
